This is where we will share what is happening on the ground — from the mobile libraries and civic education events to the AI learning fellowships and the journal.

## What to expect

Expect field notes from the settlements we work in, updates on new books and library routes, fellow spotlights, and news from the journal as it moves toward its inaugural issue.

We are glad you are here.
